PeerMesh – P2P College Data Sharing System

PeerMesh is a Python-based Peer-to-Peer college data-sharing system. It consists of four agents: Student, Faculty, Library, and Placement. Each agent can communicate directly with every other agent.

Key Features
* Fully connected P2P communication
* Student, Faculty, Library, and Placement data
* SQLite communication history
* NetworkX-based P2P network
* Streamlit web interface

Technologies
Python • Streamlit • NetworkX • SQLite • Pandas • JSON

Objective
To demonstrate decentralized data sharing and direct communication between multiple college agents using P2P architecture.
